            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The parties appearing before the Court were Karen K. Mitchell for Missouri, Irving L. Gornstein for the United States (amicus), and Amy M. Barthlow for the respondent."
      }
    ],
