        "text": "According to Justice (unspecified), according to Justice (unspecified), according to Justice (unspecified), justices inquired about the relationship between the intentionality of failing to give a Miranda warning and the voluntariness of a subsequent confession."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice (unspecified)",
